<h2>Which markets buy Indian pulses?</h2>
<p>Chickpeas move primarily to the UAE, Bangladesh and Iran; lentils to Bangladesh, Iraq and Djibouti. Beyond those, diaspora demand in Western markets supports steady smaller-volume trade in specific types and grades. See individual product pages as they're published for the cited country-level breakdowns.</p>

